{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22215","headline":"咏意 · 白居易","name":"咏意","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常闻南华经，巧劳智忧愁。\n不如无能者，饱食但遨游。\n平生爱慕道，今日近此流。\n自来浔阳郡，四序忽已周。\n不分物黑白，但与时沈浮。\n朝餐夕安寝，用是爲身谋。\n此外即闲放，时寻山水幽。\n春游慧远寺，秋上庾公楼。\n或吟诗一章，或饮茶一瓯。\n身心一无系，浩浩如虚舟。\n富贵亦有苦，苦在心危忧。\n贫贱亦有乐，乐在身自由。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}